# Every file is checked out byte for byte as it was committed, on every system. Tests compare the SHA-256 of the
# files registered on OSF (tests/test_registered.py, predictions/set_b.py, tools/verify_record.py), and Git for
# Windows sets core.autocrlf=true by default, which would otherwise rewrite line ends on checkout. The CSV files
# keep the CRLF line ends Python's csv module wrote; the rest keep LF.
* -text
